  freeCamHelp: Watch a simulation of a whale swimming in the real world! Use the
    controls below to navigate around the scene and explore to your heart's content!
    This camera allows you to explore the entire scene without following the whale.
  whalePOVHelp: Watch a simulation of a whale swimming in the real world! Use the
    controls below to navigate around the scene and explore to your heart's content!
    This camera allows you to get a closer look at the whale's perspective.
